✔ without a sheet the form blocks new creation and never opens free selection (2.790314ms)
✔ previous sessions are collapsed, exercise-scoped and show dates, sets, volume and notes (10.932877ms)
✔ previous sessions provide an empty state and support cardio history (30.354971ms)
✔ new sessions hide legacy exercises; historical edits retain their original legacy exercise (23.081991ms)
✔ sheet scope: opens straight on the first eligible exercise, with a concise position indicator (10.492657ms)
