✔ editing a recorded set updates only that set and keeps the others (10.209498ms)
✔ history suggestions are labelled, keep per-set progression and are not recorded (8.319524ms)
✔ zero load is accepted; an empty weight is not (5.561994ms)
✔ a failed save keeps the set, shows an error and retries the SAME row without duplicating it (8.689136ms)
