✔ "Finalizar com N séries" drops the untouched ones and finishes the exercise (4.859218ms)
✔ cardio: one action records the session and finishes the exercise (5.401145ms)
✔ editing an existing workout keeps the old contract: all sets, one save (9.942799ms)
✔ pressing Enter inside a field never records a set (3.222191ms)
